gametitle=Grand Theft Auto III (USA) - SLUS-20062 / 5E115FB6
// Map Toggle 1.1. Cold boot required. See README.md.
// Uses original radar tiles and HUD sprites; no ISO modification.
// Public credit: Zeroable.

[GTA-PS2-Modern-Controls\Map Toggle\Enable - Press D-Pad Down/Cross to Toggle Icons]
description=Down toggles map. On the map: Cross toggles location icons; Right sets gameplay HUD visibility. Right keeps normal gameplay controls.
author=Zeroable
// Reserve 16 KiB before game heap allocation and initialize runtime state.
